    "prompt": "Choose one scene from \"The Clocktower Key\": the day Ivy shows Mr. Okafor the key in Chapter 1, or the day she comes back in Chapter 3. Retell the scene in first person as Mr. Okafor, using I and me. Keep the events the same, but show what he thinks and feels that Ivy could not know. Include dialogue from the story and at least two of his thoughts.",
